  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LWF4s project id part of an integrated area program in the Mitrovica. The LWF part is reconstruction of 350 houses, that supplements activities undertaken by other ACT members, such as rehabilitation of school, local infrastructure, demining etc. The 350 houses are estimated to house 2600 persons, families of house owners</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">LWF4s projekt &#xe4;r ett integrerat &#xe5;teruppbyggn.program f&#xf6;r 350 fam i Motrovicat. Projektet v&#xe4;nder sig till &#xe5;terv&#xe4;ndande kosovoalbaner som &#xe5;terv&#xe4;nt sedan konflikten upph&#xf6;rt. &#xc4;garna till de 350 husen erh&#xe5;ller material f&#xf6;r att kunna vinterbona sina hem. Rep av skolor, infrastruktur och avminering mm kommer &#xe4;ven att ske via ACT</narrative>
  </description>
